<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 235 ALL OUT V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 235 ALL OUT V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were all out for 235 on the opening day of the first test against India at Kingsmead on Thursday.</p>
